        // Let's try: lock at block 1, store N+1=2 (ref) or N=1 (bug). Warp to block 3: block.number=3, blockhash(2) available (3-2=1 < 256), blockhash(1) also available (3-1=2 < 256). Both succeed. Not diverging.
